-- הסכם אופק חדש (25.12.2008), §112: a non-academic first deputy of §104(א)
-- advances in grade on his table (§109) but is not paid the grade until his
-- degree date; as if converted with the full Y; on "the conditions … for
-- academic first deputies, as in section 38(א) to (ג)".

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `base-agreement-common`
IMPORT `base-agreement-57`
§ `112`

@ref akn:art_112__para_a akn:art_112__para_a/p2
GIVEN `grade advanced to` IS A NUMBER, `grade placed at` IS A NUMBER, `reached the degree date` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the grade a non-academic first deputy is paid at` `grade advanced to` `grade placed at` `reached the degree date` IS
    `the grade he is paid at` `grade advanced to` `grade placed at` `reached the degree date`

@ref akn:art_112__para_b
GIVEN `grade by the full Y` IS A NUMBER, `grades advanced` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the grade a non-academic first deputy advances to` `grade by the full Y` `grades advanced` IS
    `the grade advanced to` `grade by the full Y` `grades advanced`

-- (ג): F-ofek-hadash-base-112-a: the academic first deputies' promotion is
-- §95's; §38(א)–(ג) is a teacher's (the clause is §83(ג)'s, itself §57(ג)'s
-- copied). The reading adopted (convention reading.misprint): §95.
@ref akn:art_112__para_c
DECLARE `deputy promotion rule` IS ONE OF `§38(א)–(ג), teachers'`, `§95, academic first deputies'`

`the rule 112(ג) cites` MEANS `§38(א)–(ג), teachers'`
`112(ג) cites the teachers' rule for the first deputies' conditions` MEANS
    NOT (`the rule 112(ג) cites` EQUALS `§95, academic first deputies'`)
#ASSERT `112(ג) cites the teachers' rule for the first deputies' conditions`
